# Vercel deploy naming

When deploying with `vercel --prod`, always pass a descriptive commit message via meta so the Vercel dashboard does not reuse a stale git HEAD message:

```bash
vercel --prod --yes -m githubCommitMessage="Short imperative summary of this change"
```

Examples:
- `fix: Meta Ads campaign chart tooltips`
- `feat: report nav General / Social / Ads / Website / SEO`
- `chore: clarify dataset source badges`

Keep the message ≤72 characters, focused on **why/what changed in this deploy**, not an old unrelated commit.
